  "sourceUrl": "https://openplatform.byd.com/#/document/index?id=13",
  "html": "<h1 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 22px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>『倍轻松』智能眼罩</strong></span></h1><h2><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>1. 车机联动功能</strong></span></h2><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">倍轻松智能眼罩通过蓝牙协议接入“智慧物联APP</span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">”，用户通过车机大屏或者车内语音助手，实现对智能眼罩热敷、按摩、模式调节等功能。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/30a4d29313cb4b209bbc09a87fec3b5b.jpg?auth_key=1795678278-3c4f813a277b4ad3b798d716ae6b5044-0-0c4c98a2915ccb39ee2077741003327a72ebb3937ff26e3000f19287b9989dee\" alt=\"画板 8.jpg\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 412.00px;height: 552.34px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图 1-1 眼罩车机联动</span></p><h3 style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 18px;\"><strong>1.1 车机大屏控制</strong></span></h3><ul><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">模式支持“美眼”、“护眼”、“睡眠”三种模式切换;</span></li><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">振动强度支持“关闭”、“轻柔”、“适中”、“强劲”四挡调节;</span></li><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">温控支持“低档”、“高档”两档调节;</span></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/3d643aa6bdd541f5938f6daef9cd06c8.png?auth_key=1795678278-11961621951b4c1883a590fb68af5411-0-17a458471c96704b004c69fbe10df5d3c5031ddef12045e95ea15d0b9ae6e216\" alt=\"首页-眼罩@2x.png\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 603.00px;height: 339.17px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图 1-2 车机端智慧物联App眼罩控制界面</span></p><h3 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 18px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>1.2 车机语音功能</strong></span></h3><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">车机智能语音实现了车机大屏控制眼罩的全部功能。方便用户解放双手，畅享按摩。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/e566ca043c5446d680d33f14c62a004d.jpg?auth_key=1795678278-611d564410c1418b9338ff82a61fb3cb-0-9609791cc2e6125462e1b61f8cc9da1d02493e3972e2494ffc795d9a2f0ae473\" alt=\"动物世界配音.00_00_31_12.Still001.jpg\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 447.00px;height: 251.42px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/7900bc67ad3544d8991bfb7d42e0ae74.jpg?auth_key=1795678278-0e0666f0c66c4dfb88545af699f146e4-0-b50b516c6c4a9de6becb1898cd4bded1276266df34cc9f1621ce1009f111518f\" alt=\"智能眼罩_场景海报01.jpg\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 450.00px;height: 660.41px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图 1-3 车内语音控制眼罩</span></p><h3 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 18px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>1.3 车机场景自动化</strong></span></h3><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">小憩场景(车机大屏及车机语音功能实现)</span></p><ul><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">按压时长设置功能；</span></li><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">按压时长显示功能；</span></li><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">设备冷敷功能；</span></li><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">设备冷热交替功能；</span></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/e2e8c50a798045078fc8574ab9efffd3.png?auth_key=1795678278-954944dd3b8d47d7aa1415ab76742544-0-b9a8037f9622695187a9a529dd26d93a52ece4a3fed5af549c433753a396326f\" alt=\"场景-日常通行-舒缓放松@2x.png\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 624.00px;height: 350.95px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图 1-4 场景自动化</span></p><h2><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>2. 手机控制功能</strong></span></h2><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">眼罩离开车机的使用场景中，手机也可控制眼罩的功能。从手机端比亚迪App的\"我的-&gt;智慧物联\"，选择智能眼罩，进入眼罩的控制界面，该界面可显示并控制眼罩剩余电量、冷/热敷状态、按压剩余时间、当前模式等。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/f497aa3074c945748933314280b70d77.png?auth_key=1795678278-a255072676bf4170bff0a7862c38761a-0-5df9ceddaa65cc7daaccac6316ce2bab65f21f97546ffb53412cb2f09f7e1ec6\" alt=\"output (1).png\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 372.00px;height: 1136.81px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图 2-1 手机控制眼罩</span></p>"
}
